#: Game.Levels.Inter.L01and
msgid "§0 means \"§1 and §2\".  To enter the symbol §3, type §4.\n"
"\n"
"### If your goal is §5\n"
"\n"
"If you have §6 and §7, then §8 is a proof of §9,\n"
"so §10 will close the goal.\n"
"If you don't yet have proofs of §11 and §12, then §13 will set §14 and §15\n"
"as separate goals.  In this situation, the tactic §16 has the same effect as\n"
"§17.\n"
"\n"
"### If you have an assumption §18\n"
"\n"
"Lean will recognize §19 as a proof of §20 and §21 as a proof of §22."
msgstr ""

#. §0: `h2`
#: Game.Levels.Combo.L05union_sub_inter_sub
