#. §15: `¬∃ x, P x`
#. §16: `∀ x, ¬P x`
#: Game.Levels.Comp.L04compcomp
msgid "If your goal is a negative statement, then the tactic §0 will try to reexpress it as\n"
"an equivalent positive statement.  Similarly, if an assumption §1 is a negative\n"
"statement, then §2 will try to reexpress §3.  Here are some examples of\n"
"reexpressions performed by the §4 tactic:\n"
"\n"
"* §5 is converted to §6.\n"
"* §7 is converted to §8.\n"
"* §9 is converted to §10.\n"
"* §11 is converted to §12.\n"
"* §13 is converted to §14.\n"
"* §15 is converted to §16."
msgstr ""

#. §0: $x$
#. §1: $U$
#. §2: $A$
#. §3: $U$
#. §4: $x ∈ A$
#. §5: $x \\in A$
