#: Game.Levels.Inter
msgid "Intersection World"
msgstr ""

#. §0: `«{h2}» : «{x}» ∉ B`
#: Game.Levels.Comp.L03compsub
msgid "This should remind you of the first level of this world.  To get a contradiction,\n"
"try to contradict §0."
msgstr ""

