#. §8: `\\rangle`
#: Game.Levels.FamUnion.L03unionsubunion
msgid "If you have an assumption §0, then the tactic §1 will\n"
"introduce a new object §2 and a new assumption §3 into the proof.  To enter the\n"
"angle brackets §4, type either §5 and §6 or §7 and §8."
