"that §7 is a subset of §8.  (To enter the symbol §9, type §10,\n"
"followed by a space.)\n"
"\n"
"If you have §11, then §12 is a proof that, if something is an element\n"
"of §13, then it is also an element of §14.  Thus, if you also have §15,\n"
"then you can apply §16 to §17 to conclude that §18.  To apply §19 to §20,\n"
